WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.610
Which means...

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.810
If we attack him here now,
 the goddess will issue her sentence.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.160
And we'll get to see it happen!

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.760
Just how bad is this going to be?
 I can't wait to find out!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.060
Understood. Resuming goddess 
retrieval operation.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.900
I just need to kill the 
redheaded host boy, right?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.750
Her staff came apart!

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.130
My Kitetsu Blade...

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.470
Seven Belled Armadillo Sword!

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.800
That sword!

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.340
One, two, three...

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.390
Seven blades?!

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.740
Have a taste of my sword skills!

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.850
Seven Lashing Swords Style 
secret technique...

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.620
Mangling Murder Wheel!

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.650
A style with seven swords 
has to be cheating!

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.750
Even if you dodge one, the rest keep coming!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.190
Just give up. Nobody likes a sore loser!

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:17.170
There you go, Nanao!

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:20.800
I'll be expecting 
a big reward for this, Master.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:26.220
One! Two! Three!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.740
And four!

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:36.960
What?!

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.900
You can evade one, 
but the rest are right behind it.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.680
Still, no matter how strong she is,
 there's only one of her.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.330
And there's three of us.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:05.890
We'll have to gamble on that.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.100
Musashi. Tsugumi.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.610
I've got a plan.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:18.950
Oh my, it seems they're putting 
together some kind of scheme.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.650
You gonna be okay by yourself, Nanao?

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:26.030
Yes. Just wait over there, Master.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.490
Our mission is to kill that redheaded boy.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.710
I'll get the job done.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>The Goddess's Power</b>

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.020
All right, you two, let's do this!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:21.910
Right!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:23.600
<i>I see...</i>

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.860
<i>They intend to come after me all at once.</i>

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:31.120
<i>I don't mind. 
My sword-whip has seven blades.</i>

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:36.620
<i>This is essentially a seven-on-three 
battle to the death.</i>

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:42.380
No amount of teamwork will help you 
 overcome these odds—

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.710
What?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.510
<i>They split up?</i>

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.920
<i>While blondie tries to take me on by himself?</i>

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:53.390
<i>That's just too reckless. 
There has to be some trick here.</i>

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.170
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.560
<i>he realized they can't win, 
so he's helping his friends escape?</i>

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.800
I can't allow the redhead to get away.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.170
Maybe I should take care 
of the blonde boy first...

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:11.630
No. My goal, above all else,
 is capturing the redhead!

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.700
Here she comes, Musashi!

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.590
Got him!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.460
Wait...

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.670
She used whips to grab my blades?

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:33.640
It's pretty easy to catch a sword 
if you know where it's headed!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.860
Three against seven...

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.840
When you're outnumbered, splitting 
up means more of a disadvantage.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.640
But if you can goad the 
enemy into bunching up...

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.810
You can catch them!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.170
Getting a hold of them won't—

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.070
Wait! You're trying to...

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.430
sunder my weapon?!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:01.870
We did it!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.200
Kojiro's plan worked perfectly!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.740
Because I knew she wouldn't attack me,

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.180
I was able to focus on catching her blades!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.900
Under the circumstances, she was bound 
to go after either me or Musashi.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.350
The three of them were able 
to break the enemy's weapon!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.680
We should be able to do this 
if we work together!

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:30.110
You destroyed one of seven blades.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.770
I'm still far from—

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.290
Master?!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.750
Great, more trouble!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.750
Are they going to fight together, too?

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:42.630
They're strong enough individually... 
What'll happen if they team up?

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.620
Coordinated attacks'll be bad news for us.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:46.970
It is what it is.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.940
They seem to be partners, after all.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:54.380
Master! I can still fight on my own!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:58.600
I... I want to be able to help you!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.550
So, please, let me handle this!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.640
We don't need to fight together yet!

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:18.880
Wh-What's up with him?

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.630
M-Master...

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:31.330
Excuse me? Why would I ever 
fight with someone like you?

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.090
Have we <i>ever</i> fought together before?

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.780
No, sir.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.980
Right? Because there's no point.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.750
I like fighting by myself best.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.870
Now, be a good girl and step back.

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:54.230
Weak allies are just a hindrance, y'know?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.040
Right...

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:07.230
I... I kinda feel sorry for her.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:18.320
The goddess isn't making her move, 
so I'm bored of this fight.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.230
I'll take the three of you out at once.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.640
What is that color?!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.190
Those are his blade rings!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.230
What are blade rings?

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:32.690
Those halos of light that appear when 
you channel power into a Kitetsu Blade.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:37.450
Up until now, that guy in the black 
hood hasn't used his.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.010
In other words...

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:43.750
We're about to see how strong he really is!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.370
H-Huh?

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.630
Nothing's happening.

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:01.140
What did he do just now?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.780
Careful, Musashi!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:09.260
Even without using his blade rings, 
his attacks were incredibly powerful.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.240
Are those walls of light?!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.590
We're trapped!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.450
There's no telling what kind of attack it is!
Best to avoid contact!

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:32.130
Oh, I wouldn't worry. 
It's not that kind of technique.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:16.980
What the?!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.770
That was close...

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.780
Kojiro! Tsugumi!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:43.100
We managed to hang on...

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.150
But if we fall, we're dead!

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.850
And it's only a matter of time!

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.380
What's going on here?!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:51.490
Why is the ground above 
us and the clouds below?!

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:54.750
Is this his doing...?

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.840
He used a single sword to slice out part
 of the world and turn it upside down?

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:01.110
People can do that?!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.430
What the hell is he?!

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:10.470
<i>This is way crazier than 
anything I've seen an oni do!</i>

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:16.120
We'd be okay if we our Kitetsu 
Blades could fly, but they can't!

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.850
I think all the bums probably fell...

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:24.820
Huh? There are a few who are 
managing to hang tough.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.870
Down you go.

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:37.870
Bastard!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.840
What are you so mad about? 
Were they your friends, too?

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:45.040
I honestly don't understand.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:50.330
You guys are trying to fight oni, right?

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:55.810
The strength you need for that... 
Why look for it in other people?

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.710
If there's someone you want to defeat,

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.980
there's only one way to go about it:

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.930
Become the strongest Bushi

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:07.710
and obtain the strongest 
Kitetsu Blade to fight with.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.760
That's all you really need. 
So why all the banding together,

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:16.850
like you're a bunch of insects, 
wriggling together to endure the cold?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.460
Oh, I get it.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.620
You're as weak as insects,

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.880
so you <i>need</i> to stick together.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.330
That's how Bushi bands work!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:29.990
<i>This jerk keeps running his mouth...</i>

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.430
<i>He sounds just like her.</i>

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.910
<i>Being in a band of Bushi is simply 
a means to an end for you.</i>

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:40.610
He's wrong.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.880
Kojiro?

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:43.790
I can't put it into words...

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:47.270
but I feel like he's wrong about this.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:49.570
Don't you, Musashi?!

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:55.660
Is that right? 
Honestly, can't say that I understand.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.100
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.090
<i>I can't let it end like this!</i>

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:15.790
<i>What is this?</i>

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.520
<i>I can't move.</i>

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.050
I finally understand...

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:34.560
just what kind of person you are.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.420
<i>The world's frozen.</i>

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.750
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.470
<i>Did you do this?</i>

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:52.050
I did. I am the force that draws 
all things together, after all.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:56.940
Right now, I'm holding light and 
sound in place for your sake.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:00.910
<i>So that Bushi in black isn't doing this?</i>

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:02.810
No.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.950
They're my enemies.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.230
They want my power.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:12.230
And they're trying to kill you 
in order to get their hands on me.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.790
Your death would be a problem for me.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.210
That's why I'm going to use 
what remains of my power...

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.480
to ensure...

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:29.920
that at least you get out of here alive.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.060
Meaning everyone else dies?

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:36.420
That's right.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.440
No thanks, then.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.660
There's no point in surviving 
if I'm the only one who does.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.140
And why is that?

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.860
Because...

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.150
I'm a weakling who can't survive alone.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.370
I know the truth.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:53.000
By myself, I'd lose sight of what matters.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.660
I can't even dream on my own.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.490
But...

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.940
when it's the two or three of us,
 I feel this power inside me!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.590
Isn't that weird?

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:07.540
I want to see how far we can go <i>together</i>!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:16.080
I had thought that this kind of selfishness 
made you unfit to be my vessel...

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:21.200
But now you have two allies willing 
to face vicious foes alongside you.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:24.350
You may not be able to survive on your own,

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:27.520
but you have a knack for drawing 
others into your struggles.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.620
That's a valuable temperament.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:34.540
Because pooling strength with 
comrades in order to fight...

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:39.760
is the only way a race as fragile as 
yours will be able to battle the Kishin.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:44.450
And that's what you want?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:49.420
You don't even have to ask. 
It always has been!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:54.260
Very good. Then I'll entrust 
you with my power.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:03.470
I shall demonstrate how I fight
 using your body.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.330
What just... Huh?

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.120
O-Our swords are reacting on their own!

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.100
My Kitetsu Blade is being 
pulled by something!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.380
They're gonna fly off my arms!

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:32.380
Something is drawing the blade energy!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:36.770
Master, th-this power... It's the real deal!

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:50.850
The thundering supernatural power 
that dwells within Kitetsu Blades...

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:52.330
<i>That</i> is blade energy.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:58.620
And there exists a black stone that can 
call upon the power of all Kitetsu Blades.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.310
Their true master...

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.750
The obsidian goddess!

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:31.840
That's a fine Kitetsu Blade you've got.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.820
Filth like you is unworthy.

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:50.720
We're saved.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.910
Heaven and earth are back where they belong!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.380
It's him...

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.960
He took the enemy's Kitetsu Blade, 
which made the technique disperse!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:07.300
Musashi? What happened to you?!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:14.980
Now then, I need to show this 
boy how to use Kitetsu Blades.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:17.430
You there, filth.

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:24.230
You've been looking for me, haven't you?

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.480
Though I can't say the feeling was mutual.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:31.800
What is that? A black blade ring?!

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.300
Musashi seems totally different...

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.670
It's like he's someone else.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:40.130
For now, just see how my 
power works, Kojiro.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.300
The obsidian goddess?!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.610
So this is the genuine article?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.800
She's warping my blade energy!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.720
It <i>has</i> to be her!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.100
Amazing...

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:00.870
He was able to deflect all those attacks!

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:05.580
Those with the black stone have 
control over blade energy.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:09.940
They can draw it toward them 
or even repel it,

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.800
not unlike a powerful magnet.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.470
But because of the unique 
nature of this power,

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.690
the vortex of magnetism 
can leave people confused

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.260
and unable to use Kitetsu Blades.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:26.870
That's the truth behind the so-called 
forsaken legend you people speak of.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.530
Are you saying Musashi can 
repel any kind of attack?!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:33.190
Is that even possible?!

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.010
He'd be invincible!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:39.670
Sadly, his invincibility 
is coming to quick end.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:49.390
My existence is a fragile one.
I was resting inside of Musashi.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:53.490
Taking action in the material world 
causes my power to fade quickly.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:57.250
I need to return to sleep soon.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:01.740
When I do, Musashi will lose
 the obsidian power...

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:05.850
even as they continue to try to kill him.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:10.270
From now on, he'll need 
to rely on his friends.

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:13.720
Are you willing to join him 
against these fearsome foes?

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:15.850
Of course I am!

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.940
There's no way I'd sit back 
and let anyone kill Musashi!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.000
I see.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.220
Thank you, Kojiro.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.270
I'm counting on you to take care of things.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:36.960
I've been wanting to meet you for so long!

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:38.870
Come and join me!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:43.210
I know I'll be able to make you happier
 than you'd be with them!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.370
Piss off.

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:54.770
I should chase them off before 
I return to my slumber.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:58.060
I'll be borrowing the power of you Bushi.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.230
What's she planning?

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:05.860
My Kitetsu Blade...

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:11.160
Is she attracting everyone's blade energy?

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:15.010
You said that Bushi are weak,

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:19.310
like insects who have to work 
together to survive, did you not?

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.010
You may be right about that.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:28.450
However... the brilliance of a single blade,

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:31.860
when joined with others, 
can shine like a constellation.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:36.450
And with the heat of a meteor shower, 
I'm going to get rid of you.

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.360
Well, bye now.

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:27.990
The Naotora Band could fly, right?!

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:29.890
Can't we do that, too?

00:23:29.890 --> 00:23:33.810
Bushi can fly with certain Kitetsu Blades, 
but those are the really expensive ones!

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:34.750
Argh!

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:37.700
Which means they're way beyond 
our current financial situation!

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Time
What's in a Katana</b>

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.860
If only I were rich!
